00:44:57.340 --> 00:44:59.720
Atty. Mark C. Vinluan: Kaya hindi niyo po malalaman.

00:44:59.720 --> 00:45:25.120
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: We're not determining, I mean, in the first place, we're not determining on the basis alone of reported CTRs or STRs whether the underlying transaction is immediately illegal or not. As part of our duties or others, as mentioned yesterday, we analyze this and then, of course, if needed, conduct investigation, file with the court, and only then we're able to establish. And even then, on our end, it's for the courts to determine if

00:45:25.120 --> 00:45:26.120
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: there's illegality or not.

00:45:26.120 --> 00:45:38.020
