00:47:04.090 --> 00:47:07.590
Atty. Mark C. Vinluan: It's in the law, Your Honor, and the witness is intelligent enough to answer.

00:47:07.590 --> 00:47:11.350
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: If he knows, if he knows, Atty. May, if you know, Atty. Rodel,

00:47:11.350 --> 00:47:11.710
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: Sorry,

00:47:11.850 --> 00:47:12.010
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: can

00:47:12.010 --> 00:47:12.130
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: you

