00:47:19.750 --> 00:47:36.970
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: The law did not mention any threshold, Your Honor. The law says, regardless of the amount, So it could be a suspicious transaction could be higher than the threshold or it could be lower than the threshold as long as the presence of suspicious circumstances are there,

00:47:37.150 --> 00:47:37.650
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: Your Honor.

00:47:37.650 --> 00:47:49.070
