00:50:30.700 --> 00:50:34.400
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: or if the client is a PEP. or a politically exposed person.

00:50:34.400 --> 00:50:35.000
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: Kasama rin po

00:50:35.000 --> 00:50:36.920
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: yan sa kinoconsider po nila. So

00:50:36.920 --> 00:50:45.860
