03:45:24.940 --> 03:45:54.430
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Siguro huling tanong na sa ngayon. Yung halaga po pinagsama ng covered transaction reports at saka yung suspicious transaction reports kina VP Duterte at Atty. Carpio. Yun lamang po yung mga diumanong kaduda-duda o sakop sa cloud na ni-report sa AMLC. Hindi po yung kompletong record ng kanilang buong financial activity, inflows and outflows. Tama po ba?

03:45:55.030 --> 03:46:06.250
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: Your Honor, yung po na-report sa amin, yung covert transaction at saspecious transaction po. Kung meron nun po na hindi pa pasok doon sa dalawang uri ng transaction po, hindi po yun maire-report sa amin po.

03:46:06.450 --> 03:46:29.510
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Right. And then, approaching that question from another angle, just winding up, Mr. Presiding Officer, kung meron namang pong gustong umiwas sa AMLC o sa pansin ng AMLC, pwede pong ibabasa 500,000 pesos ang halaga ng transaction, di po ba? Para hindi nga po mapansin ng AMLC.

03:46:30.490 --> 03:46:31.890
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: Para hindi po ma-report?

03:46:31.890 --> 03:46:32.490
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Para hindi ma

03:46:32.490 --> 03:46:33.550
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: -report ng covered transactions.

03:46:33.550 --> 03:47:12.830
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: Tama po yun, Your Honor. Kasi po hindi po siya sasaklaw dun sa covered transaction report. Kaya lang po, meron din po isang circumstance po sa suspicious transaction report na kapag na based po dun sa over... circumstances po, it appears na the client is trying to structure his transaction so as not to be reported, subject of the reporting under the law, matitreat naman po siya. Hindi po as covered transaction, kundi po suspicious po. So pero, yun nga po, subject din po yung sa checking din po ng covered person po. So makikita pa rin po, nare-report naman din po yun.

03:47:13.030 --> 03:47:39.640
Sen. Risa Hontiveros: Okay. So kahit pa po maiwas sa pansin ng AMLC or ng covered person bilang covered transaction report. Kung may mapansin pong circumstance na parang sinusubukang i-structure yung transactions, pwede pa rin pong masakop ng isang suspicious transaction report. Alright. Marami salamat po muli, Atty. Buenaventura. Salamat po, Mr. Presiding Officer.

03:47:39.640 --> 03:47:39.960
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank

03:47:39.960 --> 03:47:44.980
