03:48:31.270 --> 03:48:47.110
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: Ano naman po yun, Your Honor? So, pag na-report po sa amin, meron lang po kaming prioritization po, given nga po na maliit lang po yung ahensya at yung resources po. So, namimili po kami base po dun sa mga kung ano po yung ipaprioritize na investigahan po.

03:48:47.230 --> 03:48:49.430
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Hindi mention maliliit. Paano kung malalaki?

03:48:51.660 --> 03:48:56.660
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: accounts at malalaki ang transaksyon na perang lamabas-pasok. So, what do you do?

03:48:56.880 --> 03:49:13.860
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: Kasama pa rin po yun sa prioritization po. Hindi naman po porket maliit or malaki yung pera. Yun lang po yung basihan namin. So, halimbawa po, if the crime po ay halimbawa ay terrorism financing, so, mas priority po namin yung kahit po mas maliit ng content dahil may national security concern po.

03:49:14.060 --> 03:49:16.720
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Kaya nga, what do you do? What kind of investigation do you conduct?

03:49:17.380 --> 03:49:38.020
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: After po noon, so, we analyze po the transactions po. and then at least dun sa initial transaction na analysis po kung meron po kaming makita na medyo that parang kailangan investigahan pa po ng mas detalyado i-endorse na po namin yun. sa kabilang grupo na mag-i-investigate na po talaga.

03:49:38.040 --> 03:49:39.120
