03:49:39.500 --> 03:49:42.140
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: Sa internal unit lang po yun sa AMLC.

03:49:42.140 --> 03:49:42.940
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: Kaya nga, and then anong

03:49:42.940 --> 03:49:43.800
