03:52:29.270 --> 03:52:39.410
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: In policy lang, yun nga po Your Honor, yung pong may mga halimbawa po nag-file po kami sa Court of Appeals for bank inquiry po, may nakalagay po kasi sa rules nila.

03:52:39.410 --> 03:52:42.010
Sen. Raffy T. Tulfo: So, ginawa nyo ba ito?

03:52:42.010 --> 03:52:43.010
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: Kasama po doon na

03:52:43.010 --> 03:52:43.290
AMLC Executive Director Atty. Ronel U. Buenaventura: we

03:52:43.290 --> 03:52:50.050
